    <h1>Brain Puzzle 3 Level 104 Answer: Help drive away the scumbag and find a good man</h1>

    <div class="disclaimer">Unofficial fan-made guide. Not affiliated with the developer of Brain Puzzle 3.</div>
<div class="verify-note">Scene and goal confirmed by a second independent guide (showgamer); the two write some moves differently, so if a step does not react, compare with the embedded video.</div>
    <div class="answer-box">
      <span class="label">Quick answer</span>
      <p>Level 104 “Spot Player”: Help drive away the scumbag and find a good man 22 moves in order (6 drags, 2 taps, 1 swipes). Follow the step cards below or copy the video move-for-move.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="hero-link" href="#video" aria-label="Jump to the level 104 full solution video">
