    </a>
    <h2>Watch the full solution<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <p>The video is the fastest way to copy this level move-for-move: some moves are drags, not taps, and text alone cannot show the gesture. Third-party recording, so its level number may differ from yours. Match the scene, not the number. This recording is labelled <strong>Level 88</strong> — identical scene, different numbering.</p>
    <div class="video-wrap" id="video">
      <iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/mQUAZ6kk1os" title="Brain Puzzle 3 Level 104 walkthrough video" loading="lazy" allowfullscreen></iframe>
    </div>
    <InContentAd />

    <h2>Level 104 walkthrough: every move in order<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 1–3</span>
      <strong>Pull down the man's glove (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Pull down the man's glove. Drive away the man with a ring on his hand. Drag the bucket to the man.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 4–6</span>
      <strong>Drive away the man with a hickey (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drive away the man with a hickey on his face. Pull down the man's collar. Drive away the man wearing black suspenders.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 7–9</span>
      <strong>Drag the scissors (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the scissors to the curtain. Drag the maid outfit from the sofa to the female cleaner. Drive away the man who can't resist temptation.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 10–12</span>
      <strong>Swipe up (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Swipe up on the man's clothes. Drag the makeup remover from the table to the man. Drive away the man with abnormal skin.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 13–15</span>
      <strong>Tap the phone (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Tap the phone on the table. Drag the phone on the table to the man. Drive away the man who pretends to be straight.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 16–18</span>
      <strong>Drag the girl's tie (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the girl's tie to the man. Drive away the man with a flamboyant posture. Tap the right pocket of the man's suit.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 19–21</span>
      <strong>Drive away the man with many hotel key cards (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drive away the man with many hotel key cards. Click the breast pocket of the man's suit. Click the phone inside the pocket.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Step 22</span>
      <strong>Drive away the womanizing man</strong>
      <p>Drive away the womanizing man.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>If your level 104 shows “Bridge Lighten”<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <p>Brain Puzzle 3 does not hand every player the same scene at the same number: builds and
    install order differ, and both variants are on record. If the banner on your screen reads
    “Reduce the weight the suspension bridge has to bear.”, this is that scene, 15 moves in order:</p>
    <ol class="alt-steps">
        <li>Drag the rich lady's handbag to under the suspension bridge.</li>
        <li>Drag the rich lady's jacket to under the suspension bridge.</li>
        <li>Drag the rich lady's gold watch to under the suspension bridge.</li>
        <li>Drag the bee to the handsome guy.</li>
        <li>Swipe up on the dress woman's skirt.</li>
        <li>Drag the spy's razor to the woman in the dress.</li>
        <li>Drag the handsome man's scissors to the woman in the dress.</li>
        <li>Click the spy's leather shoes.</li>
        <li>Swipe up on the agent's pants.</li>
        <li>Click the sandbag.</li>
        <li>Drag the bread in the fat man's hand to the cat.</li>
        <li>Swipe down on the fat man.</li>
        <li>Drag the snacks inside the fat man's clothes to under the suspension bridge.</li>
        <li>Drag the umbrella to the athlete.</li>
        <li>Swipe left on the cloud.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>FAQ<span class="accent">.</span></h2>

    <details><summary>What is the answer to Brain Puzzle 3 Level 104?</summary><p>In order: 1) Pull down the man's glove; 2) Drive away the man with a ring on his hand; 3) Drag the bucket to the man; 4) Drive away the man with a hickey on his face; 5) Pull down the man's collar; 6) Drive away the man wearing black suspenders; 7) Drag the scissors to the curtain; 8) Drag the maid outfit from the sofa to the female cleaner; 9) Drive away the man who can't resist temptation; 10) Swipe up on the man's clothes; 11) Drag the makeup remover from the table to the man; 12) Drive away the man with abnormal skin; 13) Tap the phone on the table; 14) Drag the phone on the table to the man; 15) Drive away the man who pretends to be straight; 16) Drag the girl's tie to the man; 17) Drive away the man with a flamboyant posture; 18) Tap the right pocket of the man's suit; 19) Drive away the man with many hotel key cards.; 20) Click the breast pocket of the man's suit.; 21) Click the phone inside the pocket.; 22) Drive away the womanizing man.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Why does nothing happen when I tap in Level 104?</summary><p>Level 104 mixes gestures: 6 drags, 2 taps, 1 swipes. Only the tap steps answer a single tap; the rest are drags or swipes. If a tap does nothing, try dragging the object onto the person or thing it belongs to.</p></details>
